window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b292-f2d7a65611d2c8b9.json"]={sha256:"f2d7a65611d2c8b9075f2b31d598581822567cc9e000c29aa8ecdbd52b920172",value:{"id":"b292","title":"大型船閘灌排水系統","titleEn":"Filling and emptying systems for navigation locks","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從水量平衡到瞬變與船舶受力理解大型船閘灌排系統。課程從邊界辨識與資料整理走到水理量化、構造介面及驗證紀錄；每一步把計算結果連回可量測的證據。十個不同單元分別處理關鍵機制，不以名義尺寸或單一通過率代替整體工程判斷，並明列合成算例與現地資料的差別。","summaryEn":"Understand large-lock filling through water balance, transients and vessel forces. The course moves from boundary identification and evidence to hydraulic quantification, structural interfaces and verification records. Ten distinct units connect each calculated quantity to measurable evidence. Nominal geometry or a single pass rate does not establish whole-system performance, and synthetic teaching examples remain separate from field observations.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-coasts","subcategoryTitle":"海岸、港灣與水資源韌性","subcategoryTitleEn":"Coasts, ports and water-resource resilience","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-coasts","learningTags":["water","water-coasts","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-lock","architectureNodes":[["閘室有效水量","Effective chamber water volume"],["水位上升與空間均勻","Level rise and spatial uniformity"],["平水末段時間","Late-stage equalization time"],["射流動量與導流","Jet momentum and redirection"],["水面坡度與繫泊需求","Surface gradient and mooring demand"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1]],"diagram":{"type":"water-lock","labels":["閘室有效水量","水位上升與空間均勻","平水末段時間","射流動量與導流","水面坡度與繫泊需求"],"labelsEn":["Effective chamber water volume","Level rise and spatial uniformity","Late-stage equalization time","Jet momentum and redirection","Surface gradient and mooring demand"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"以下為原創合成算例，不是地標工程的實測或推薦操作值。教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設空閘長300m、寬30m且垂直壁，水位升10m，ΔV=LBΔh=90000m³；不含節水池或船舶幾何。假設升水高度由10加10%至11m、空閘平面固定，水量由90000增至99000m³；若另假設平均流量仍150m³/s，時間600增至660s，但實際流量時程需重算。重新計算前先列固定條件、單位、適用尺度及可能失效的邊界。把模型敏感度與測量誤差分開，不能將單一參數變化直接當成工程風險或壽命比例。比較兩次結果後，記錄還需要哪些獨立證據，並由負責專業人員判斷適用性。","textEn":"This original synthetic example is neither a landmark measurement nor a recommended operating value. Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume an empty vertical-sided chamber300m long and30m wide with a10m rise. ΔV=LBΔh=90000m³, excluding basins and vessel geometry. Increasing lift10% from10to11m at fixed empty-chamber plan increases volume90000to99000m³. If mean discharge is separately held at150m³/s, time rises600to660s; the actual hydrograph must be recalculated. Before recalculating, list fixed conditions, units, applicable scale and boundaries that could fail. Separate model sensitivity from measurement uncertainty: a parameter change does not directly give a proportional change in engineering risk or service life. Compare the results, record independent evidence still needed, and have the responsible specialist determine applicability.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b292-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「閘室有效水量」與「平均流量與灌水時間」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Effective chamber water volume\" and \"Mean discharge and filling time\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b292-v15-01","title":"閘室有效水量：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Effective chamber water volume: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「閘室有效水量」如何影響大型船閘灌排水系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Effective chamber water volume” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Filling and emptying systems for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"閘室水位變化所需水量由有效水平面積積分，船舶排水、局部台階與側室會影響實際幾何。矩形空閘示意只是基本量級，水量還要連到上游庫與下游河段收支；不能把一次升降量直接當成每日取水量，因為節水池與交通次序不同。 假設空閘長300m、寬30m且垂直壁，水位升10m，ΔV=LBΔh=90000m³；不含節水池或船舶幾何。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「閘室有效水量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Required water volume follows integration of effective horizontal area with level; vessel displacement, steps and side spaces modify geometry. An empty rectangular chamber supplies a basic scale only, which must connect to upstream and downstream balances. One level-change volume is not daily freshwater demand because water-saving basins, traffic direction and operating sequences alter the complete system accounting. Assume an empty vertical-sided chamber300m long and30m wide with a10m rise. ΔV=LBΔh=90000m³, excluding basins and vessel geometry. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Effective chamber water volume” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「閘室全部容積就是每次通航必須重新消耗的淡水量。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The entire chamber volume is fresh water that must be consumed anew on every transit.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「閘室有效水量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Effective chamber water volume”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-01-k1","title":"閘室有效水量","titleEn":"Effective chamber water volume","text":"閘室水位變化所需水量由有效水平面積積分，船舶排水、局部台階與側室會影響實際幾何。矩形空閘示意只是基本量級，水量還要連到上游庫與下游河段收支；不能把一次升降量直接當成每日取水量，因為節水池與交通次序不同。","textEn":"Required water volume follows integration of effective horizontal area with level; vessel displacement, steps and side spaces modify geometry. An empty rectangular chamber supplies a basic scale only, which must connect to upstream and downstream balances.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：閘室全部容積就是每次通航必須重新消耗的淡水量。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The entire chamber volume is fresh water that must be consumed anew on every transit. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「閘室有效水量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Effective chamber water volume\" is correct?","options":["閘室全部容積就是每次通航必須重新消耗的淡水量。","閘室水位變化所需水量由有效水平面積積分，船舶排水、局部台階與側室會影響實際幾何。","峰值流量除以總水量即可準確代表整個灌排所需時間。"],"optionsEn":["The entire chamber volume is fresh water that must be consumed anew on every transit.","Required water volume follows integration of effective horizontal area with level; vessel displacement, steps and side spaces modify geometry.","Peak discharge alone provides an accurate filling duration for the complete chamber volume."],"answer":1,"explanation":"閘室水位變化所需水量由有效水平面積積分，船舶排水、局部台階與側室會影響實際幾何。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Required water volume follows integration of effective horizontal area with level; vessel displacement, steps and side spaces modify geometry. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b292-v15-02","title":"閘室有效水量：定量估算","titleEn":"Effective chamber water volume: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「閘室有效水量」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Effective chamber water volume” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設空閘長300m、寬30m且垂直壁，水位升10m，ΔV=LBΔh=90000m³；不含節水池或船舶幾何。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume an empty vertical-sided chamber300m long and30m wide with a10m rise. ΔV=LBΔh=90000m³, excluding basins and vessel geometry. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用閘室各高程平面面積核對容積曲線，標明是否含船舶及側廊道。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Verify the volume-elevation curve from sectional areas, identifying vessel and side-space treatment.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設空閘長300m、寬30m且垂直壁，水位升10m，ΔV=LBΔh=90000m³；不含節水池或船舶幾何。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume an empty vertical-sided chamber300m long and30m wide with a10m rise. ΔV=LBΔh=90000m³, excluding basins and vessel geometry.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「閘室有效水量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Effective chamber water volume\", which statement holds?","options":["閥門開度固定時流量就不受兩側水頭差變化影響。","廊道總水頭損失較小就保證船閘內水流一定更均勻。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["A fixed valve opening makes flow independent of the changing head difference.","Lower total culvert head loss guarantees a more uniform flow field inside the lock.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b292-v15-03","title":"閘室有效水量：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Effective chamber water volume: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「閘室有效水量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Effective chamber water volume” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用閘室各高程平面面積核對容積曲線，標明是否含船舶及側廊道。將每次灌排的來源去向畫成收支圖，核對節水交換是否重複計入，並保留不同交通方向的水量差異。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Verify the volume-elevation curve from sectional areas, identifying vessel and side-space treatment. Map source and destination for each filling step, checking duplicated saving-basin exchange and retaining water-budget differences between traffic directions instead of assuming all lockages are identical. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：用閘室各高程平面面積核對容積曲線，標明是否含船舶及側廊道。將每次灌排的來源去向畫成收支圖，核對節水交換是否重複計入，並保留不同交通方向的水量差異。","observationEn":"Site practice: Verify the volume-elevation curve from sectional areas, identifying vessel and side-space treatment. Map source and destination for each filling step, checking duplicated saving-basin exchange and retaining water-budget differences between traffic directions instead of assuming all lockages are identical.","failure":"注意干擾：把總閘室容積當升降用水會高估單次需求，忽略船舶與連通空間又可能漏掉水位相關面積。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using total chamber volume as lift water overstates demand, while ignored vessels or connected spaces misstate level-dependent area. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用閘室各高程平面面積核對容積曲線，標明是否含船舶及側廊道。將每次灌排的來源去向畫成收支圖，核對節水交換是否重複計入，並保留不同交通方向的水量差異。","textEn":"Verify the volume-elevation curve from sectional areas, identifying vessel and side-space treatment. Map source and destination for each filling step, checking duplicated saving-basin exchange and retaining water-budget differences between traffic directions instead of assuming all lockages are identical.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"用閘室各高程平面面積核對容積曲線，標明是否含船舶及側廊道。將每次灌排的來源去向畫成收支圖，核對節水交換是否重複計入，並保留不同交通方向的水量差異。","textEn":"Verify the volume-elevation curve from sectional areas, identifying vessel and side-space treatment. Map source and destination for each filling step, checking duplicated saving-basin exchange and retaining water-budget differences between traffic directions instead of assuming all lockages are identical.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「閘室有效水量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Effective chamber water volume\"?","options":["用閘室各高程平面面積核對容積曲線，標明是否含船舶及側廊道。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","任何速度變化無論多慢都會產生相同的焦可夫斯基峰值水錘。"],"optionsEn":["Verify the volume-elevation curve from sectional areas, identifying vessel and side-space treatment.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Every velocity change produces the same Joukowsky peak regardless of how slowly it occurs."],"answer":0,"explanation":"用閘室各高程平面面積核對容積曲線，標明是否含船舶及側廊道。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Verify the volume-elevation curve from sectional areas, identifying vessel and side-space treatment. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b292-v15-04","title":"閘室有效水量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Effective chamber water volume: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「閘室有效水量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Effective chamber water volume” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把總閘室容積當升降用水會高估單次需求，忽略船舶與連通空間又可能漏掉水位相關面積。若把回收水當新取水，則會錯判整個水源系統的壓力。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using total chamber volume as lift water overstates demand, while ignored vessels or connected spaces misstate level-dependent area. Counting recovered water as fresh withdrawal then distorts the load placed on the wider source-water system. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設空閘長300m、寬30m且垂直壁，水位升10m，ΔV=LBΔh=90000m³；不含節水池或船舶幾何。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Assume an empty vertical-sided chamber300m long and30m wide with a10m rise. ΔV=LBΔh=90000m³, excluding basins and vessel geometry.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「閘室全部容積就是每次通航必須重新消耗的淡水量。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The entire chamber volume is fresh water that must be consumed anew on every transit.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把總閘室容積當升降用水會高估單次需求，忽略船舶與連通空間又可能漏掉水位相關面積。若把回收水當新取水，則會錯判整個水源系統的壓力。","textEn":"Using total chamber volume as lift water overstates demand, while ignored vessels or connected spaces misstate level-dependent area. Counting recovered water as fresh withdrawal then distorts the load placed on the wider source-water system.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「閘室有效水量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Effective chamber water volume\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","把總閘室容積當升降用水會高估單次需求，忽略船舶與連通空間又可能漏掉水位相關面積。","峰值流量除以總水量即可準確代表整個灌排所需時間。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Using total chamber volume as lift water overstates demand, while ignored vessels or connected spaces misstate level-dependent area.","Peak discharge alone provides an accurate filling duration for the complete chamber volume."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把總閘室容積當升降用水會高估單次需求，忽略船舶與連通空間又可能漏掉水位相關面積。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using total chamber volume as lift water overstates demand, while ignored vessels or connected spaces misstate level-dependent area. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b292-v15-05","title":"平均流量與灌水時間：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Mean discharge and filling time: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「平均流量與灌水時間」如何影響大型船閘灌排水系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Mean discharge and filling time” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Filling and emptying systems for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"灌水時間由流量時程積分決定，平均流量只是一項事後或假設摘要。水頭隨閘室上升而降低，閥門與廊道慣性又使流量不會立即達峰；因此恆流除法適合收支檢查，不能生成現場操作時程，更不能只以最短時間評估系統功能。 假設所需補水量90000m³、整段平均流量150m³/s，t=V/Qavg=600s=10min；不表示瞬時流量恆定。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「平均流量與灌水時間」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Filling duration follows integration of the discharge history, with mean discharge merely a summary or assumption. Head decreases as the chamber rises, and valves plus culvert inertia prevent instantaneous peak flow. Constant-flow division checks accounting but cannot generate an operational schedule or establish performance merely by minimizing elapsed time without considering water-surface disturbance and vessel response. Assume required volume90000m³ and interval-mean discharge150m³/s. t=V/Qavg=600s=10min, without implying constant instantaneous flow. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Mean discharge and filling time” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「峰值流量除以總水量即可準確代表整個灌排所需時間。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Peak discharge alone provides an accurate filling duration for the complete chamber volume.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「平均流量與灌水時間」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Mean discharge and filling time”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-05-k1","title":"平均流量與灌水時間","titleEn":"Mean discharge and filling time","text":"灌水時間由流量時程積分決定，平均流量只是一項事後或假設摘要。水頭隨閘室上升而降低，閥門與廊道慣性又使流量不會立即達峰；因此恆流除法適合收支檢查，不能生成現場操作時程，更不能只以最短時間評估系統功能。","textEn":"Filling duration follows integration of the discharge history, with mean discharge merely a summary or assumption. Head decreases as the chamber rises, and valves plus culvert inertia prevent instantaneous peak flow.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：峰值流量除以總水量即可準確代表整個灌排所需時間。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Peak discharge alone provides an accurate filling duration for the complete chamber volume. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「平均流量與灌水時間」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Mean discharge and filling time\" is correct?","options":["峰值流量除以總水量即可準確代表整個灌排所需時間。","平均水位上升率穩定就證明閘室所有位置都沒有水面振盪。","灌水時間由流量時程積分決定，平均流量只是一項事後或假設摘要。"],"optionsEn":["Peak discharge alone provides an accurate filling duration for the complete chamber volume.","A steady mean rise proves that no surface oscillation exists anywhere in the chamber.","Filling duration follows integration of the discharge history, with mean discharge merely a summary or assumption."],"answer":2,"explanation":"灌水時間由流量時程積分決定，平均流量只是一項事後或假設摘要。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Filling duration follows integration of the discharge history, with mean discharge merely a summary or assumption. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b292-v15-06","title":"平均流量與灌水時間：定量估算","titleEn":"Mean discharge and filling time: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「平均流量與灌水時間」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Mean discharge and filling time” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設所需補水量90000m³、整段平均流量150m³/s，t=V/Qavg=600s=10min；不表示瞬時流量恆定。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume required volume90000m³ and interval-mean discharge150m³/s. t=V/Qavg=600s=10min, without implying constant instantaneous flow. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：積分實測流量曲線與水位容積變化交叉核對，明列開閥前後是否納入計時。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Cross-check the integrated hydrograph against level-derived volume and define the timing interval.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設所需補水量90000m³、整段平均流量150m³/s，t=V/Qavg=600s=10min；不表示瞬時流量恆定。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume required volume90000m³ and interval-mean discharge150m³/s. t=V/Qavg=600s=10min, without implying constant instantaneous flow.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「平均流量與灌水時間」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Mean discharge and filling time\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","只要某一瞬間兩側水位相等就代表後續不會再有壓差。","灌水射流的全部動量反力都必定直接施加在閘內船舶上。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","One instant of equal levels proves that no pressure difference can develop afterward.","The entire filling-jet momentum reaction necessarily acts directly on the vessel in the chamber."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b292-v15-07","title":"平均流量與灌水時間：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Mean discharge and filling time: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「平均流量與灌水時間」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Mean discharge and filling time” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"積分實測流量曲線與水位容積變化交叉核對，明列開閥前後是否納入計時。檢查末段水頭變小時的流量衰減，並把船舶運動與壓力資料對時，不以時間達標取代其他性能。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Cross-check the integrated hydrograph against level-derived volume and define the timing interval. Inspect declining flow near equalization and align vessel-motion and pressure records, ensuring a target duration does not substitute for verification of the other hydraulic performance measures. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：積分實測流量曲線與水位容積變化交叉核對，明列開閥前後是否納入計時。檢查末段水頭變小時的流量衰減，並把船舶運動與壓力資料對時，不以時間達標取代其他性能。","observationEn":"Site practice: Cross-check the integrated hydrograph against level-derived volume and define the timing interval. Inspect declining flow near equalization and align vessel-motion and pressure records, ensuring a target duration does not substitute for verification of the other hydraulic performance measures.","failure":"注意干擾：以峰值流量計算全程會低估灌水時間，未量到的漏流則讓容積核對不閉合。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using peak flow throughout understates filling time, while unmeasured leakage prevents volume closure. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"積分實測流量曲線與水位容積變化交叉核對，明列開閥前後是否納入計時。檢查末段水頭變小時的流量衰減，並把船舶運動與壓力資料對時，不以時間達標取代其他性能。","textEn":"Cross-check the integrated hydrograph against level-derived volume and define the timing interval. Inspect declining flow near equalization and align vessel-motion and pressure records, ensuring a target duration does not substitute for verification of the other hydraulic performance measures.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"積分實測流量曲線與水位容積變化交叉核對，明列開閥前後是否納入計時。檢查末段水頭變小時的流量衰減，並把船舶運動與壓力資料對時，不以時間達標取代其他性能。","textEn":"Cross-check the integrated hydrograph against level-derived volume and define the timing interval. Inspect declining flow near equalization and align vessel-motion and pressure records, ensuring a target duration does not substitute for verification of the other hydraulic performance measures.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「平均流量與灌水時間」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Mean discharge and filling time\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","積分實測流量曲線與水位容積變化交叉核對，明列開閥前後是否納入計時。","壓力計顯示正表壓就可以排除閥內所有局部空化現象。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Cross-check the integrated hydrograph against level-derived volume and define the timing interval.","Positive gauge pressure at one sensor rules out all local cavitation inside the valve."],"answer":1,"explanation":"積分實測流量曲線與水位容積變化交叉核對，明列開閥前後是否納入計時。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Cross-check the integrated hydrograph against level-derived volume and define the timing interval. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b292-v15-08","title":"平均流量與灌水時間：失效診斷","titleEn":"Mean discharge and filling time: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「平均流量與灌水時間」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Mean discharge and filling time” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"以峰值流量計算全程會低估灌水時間，未量到的漏流則讓容積核對不閉合。更快的平均灌水也可能伴隨更大水面坡度，不能直接解讀為整體品質提升。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using peak flow throughout understates filling time, while unmeasured leakage prevents volume closure. Faster average filling may accompany larger surface gradients, so speed alone cannot be interpreted as an improvement in complete system performance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設所需補水量90000m³、整段平均流量150m³/s，t=V/Qavg=600s=10min；不表示瞬時流量恆定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Assume required volume90000m³ and interval-mean discharge150m³/s. t=V/Qavg=600s=10min, without implying constant instantaneous flow.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「峰值流量除以總水量即可準確代表整個灌排所需時間。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Peak discharge alone provides an accurate filling duration for the complete chamber volume.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"以峰值流量計算全程會低估灌水時間，未量到的漏流則讓容積核對不閉合。更快的平均灌水也可能伴隨更大水面坡度，不能直接解讀為整體品質提升。","textEn":"Using peak flow throughout understates filling time, while unmeasured leakage prevents volume closure. Faster average filling may accompany larger surface gradients, so speed alone cannot be interpreted as an improvement in complete system performance.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「平均流量與灌水時間」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Mean discharge and filling time\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","平均水位上升率穩定就證明閘室所有位置都沒有水面振盪。","以峰值流量計算全程會低估灌水時間，未量到的漏流則讓容積核對不閉合。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","A steady mean rise proves that no surface oscillation exists anywhere in the chamber.","Using peak flow throughout understates filling time, while unmeasured leakage prevents volume closure."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以峰值流量計算全程會低估灌水時間，未量到的漏流則讓容積核對不閉合。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using peak flow throughout understates filling time, while unmeasured leakage prevents volume closure. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b292-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「水位上升與空間均勻」與「孔口水頭流量」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Level rise and spatial uniformity\" and \"Orifice head-discharge relation\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b292-v15-09","title":"水位上升與空間均勻：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Level rise and spatial uniformity: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「水位上升與空間均勻」如何影響大型船閘灌排水系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Level rise and spatial uniformity” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Filling and emptying systems for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"連續方程把淨入流轉成平均水位上升率，但長閘室內可能同時存在波動與局部射流。平均值不能顯示船首船尾水位差，也不能代表每個港池的瞬時變化；需以多點水位資料檢查空間均勻性，並把流量與幾何定義維持一致。 假設有效面積9000m²、淨入流150m³/s，dη/dt=Q/A=0.01667m/s=1m/min；僅是空間平均。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「水位上升與空間均勻」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Continuity converts net inflow into mean level rise, but a long chamber can simultaneously contain waves and local jets. The average does not show the difference between bow and stern elevations or every local instantaneous change. Multiple gauges must test spatial uniformity, with flow and effective area consistently defined before interpreting an apparent match between average water level and discharge. Assume effective area9000m² and net inflow150m³/s. Mean rise Q/A=0.01667m/s=1m/min, not every local surface velocity. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Level rise and spatial uniformity” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「平均水位上升率穩定就證明閘室所有位置都沒有水面振盪。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A steady mean rise proves that no surface oscillation exists anywhere in the chamber.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「水位上升與空間均勻」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Level rise and spatial uniformity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-09-k1","title":"水位上升與空間均勻","titleEn":"Level rise and spatial uniformity","text":"連續方程把淨入流轉成平均水位上升率，但長閘室內可能同時存在波動與局部射流。平均值不能顯示船首船尾水位差，也不能代表每個港池的瞬時變化；需以多點水位資料檢查空間均勻性，並把流量與幾何定義維持一致。","textEn":"Continuity converts net inflow into mean level rise, but a long chamber can simultaneously contain waves and local jets. The average does not show the difference between bow and stern elevations or every local instantaneous change.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：平均水位上升率穩定就證明閘室所有位置都沒有水面振盪。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A steady mean rise proves that no surface oscillation exists anywhere in the chamber. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「水位上升與空間均勻」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Level rise and spatial uniformity\" is correct?","options":["連續方程把淨入流轉成平均水位上升率，但長閘室內可能同時存在波動與局部射流。","平均水位上升率穩定就證明閘室所有位置都沒有水面振盪。","閥門開度固定時流量就不受兩側水頭差變化影響。"],"optionsEn":["Continuity converts net inflow into mean level rise, but a long chamber can simultaneously contain waves and local jets.","A steady mean rise proves that no surface oscillation exists anywhere in the chamber.","A fixed valve opening makes flow independent of the changing head difference."],"answer":0,"explanation":"連續方程把淨入流轉成平均水位上升率，但長閘室內可能同時存在波動與局部射流。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Continuity converts net inflow into mean level rise, but a long chamber can simultaneously contain waves and local jets. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b292-v15-10","title":"水位上升與空間均勻：定量估算","titleEn":"Level rise and spatial uniformity: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「水位上升與空間均勻」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Level rise and spatial uniformity” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設有效面積9000m²、淨入流150m³/s，dη/dt=Q/A=0.01667m/s=1m/min；僅是空間平均。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume effective area9000m² and net inflow150m³/s. Mean rise Q/A=0.01667m/s=1m/min, not every local surface velocity. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：沿閘室和船側同步量水位，先求平均再檢查各測點偏離與相位，核對淨流量是否已扣出流。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure levels synchronously along the chamber and vessel, comparing mean, deviations and phase and checking that net flow excludes outflow.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設有效面積9000m²、淨入流150m³/s，dη/dt=Q/A=0.01667m/s=1m/min；僅是空間平均。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume effective area9000m² and net inflow150m³/s. Mean rise Q/A=0.01667m/s=1m/min, not every local surface velocity.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「水位上升與空間均勻」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Level rise and spatial uniformity\", which statement holds?","options":["廊道總水頭損失較小就保證船閘內水流一定更均勻。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","任何速度變化無論多慢都會產生相同的焦可夫斯基峰值水錘。"],"optionsEn":["Lower total culvert head loss guarantees a more uniform flow field inside the lock.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Every velocity change produces the same Joukowsky peak regardless of how slowly it occurs."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b292-v15-11","title":"水位上升與空間均勻：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Level rise and spatial uniformity: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「水位上升與空間均勻」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Level rise and spatial uniformity” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"沿閘室和船側同步量水位，先求平均再檢查各測點偏離與相位，核對淨流量是否已扣出流。將局部高差與船舶運動連結，避免僅靠一支水位計宣告灌水均勻。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure levels synchronously along the chamber and vessel, comparing mean, deviations and phase and checking that net flow excludes outflow. Relate local gradients to vessel motion rather than declaring uniform filling from one level sensor that happens to follow the average. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：沿閘室和船側同步量水位，先求平均再檢查各測點偏離與相位，核對淨流量是否已扣出流。將局部高差與船舶運動連結，避免僅靠一支水位計宣告灌水均勻。","observationEn":"Site practice: Measure levels synchronously along the chamber and vessel, comparing mean, deviations and phase and checking that net flow excludes outflow. Relate local gradients to vessel motion rather than declaring uniform filling from one level sensor that happens to follow the average.","failure":"注意干擾：感測器位在節點可能看不到明顯振盪，平均上升率正確仍可能有船端受力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A sensor near a modal node may miss oscillation even when vessel-end forces are significant. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"沿閘室和船側同步量水位，先求平均再檢查各測點偏離與相位，核對淨流量是否已扣出流。將局部高差與船舶運動連結，避免僅靠一支水位計宣告灌水均勻。","textEn":"Measure levels synchronously along the chamber and vessel, comparing mean, deviations and phase and checking that net flow excludes outflow. Relate local gradients to vessel motion rather than declaring uniform filling from one level sensor that happens to follow the average.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"沿閘室和船側同步量水位，先求平均再檢查各測點偏離與相位，核對淨流量是否已扣出流。將局部高差與船舶運動連結，避免僅靠一支水位計宣告灌水均勻。","textEn":"Measure levels synchronously along the chamber and vessel, comparing mean, deviations and phase and checking that net flow excludes outflow. Relate local gradients to vessel motion rather than declaring uniform filling from one level sensor that happens to follow the average.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「水位上升與空間均勻」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Level rise and spatial uniformity\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","船舶所有繫纜力都可由兩端水位差單獨精確決定。","沿閘室和船側同步量水位，先求平均再檢查各測點偏離與相位，核對淨流量是否已扣出流。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","The complete vessel mooring force is exactly determined by end-to-end level difference alone.","Measure levels synchronously along the chamber and vessel, comparing mean, deviations and phase and checking that net flow excludes outflow."],"answer":2,"explanation":"沿閘室和船側同步量水位，先求平均再檢查各測點偏離與相位，核對淨流量是否已扣出流。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure levels synchronously along the chamber and vessel, comparing mean, deviations and phase and checking that net flow excludes outflow. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b292-v15-12","title":"水位上升與空間均勻：失效診斷","titleEn":"Level rise and spatial uniformity: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「水位上升與空間均勻」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Level rise and spatial uniformity” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"感測器位在節點可能看不到明顯振盪，平均上升率正確仍可能有船端受力。漏掉排水支路也會讓入流量推算比實際水位變化快，造成假異常。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A sensor near a modal node may miss oscillation even when vessel-end forces are significant. An omitted outlet also makes inflow-derived rise exceed the measured rate, creating an apparent anomaly unrelated to the filling distribution itself. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設有效面積9000m²、淨入流150m³/s，dη/dt=Q/A=0.01667m/s=1m/min；僅是空間平均。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Mean rise Q/A=0.01667m/s=1m/min, not every local surface velocity.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「平均水位上升率穩定就證明閘室所有位置都沒有水面振盪。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A steady mean rise proves that no surface oscillation exists anywhere in the chamber.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"感測器位在節點可能看不到明顯振盪，平均上升率正確仍可能有船端受力。漏掉排水支路也會讓入流量推算比實際水位變化快，造成假異常。","textEn":"A sensor near a modal node may miss oscillation even when vessel-end forces are significant. An omitted outlet also makes inflow-derived rise exceed the measured rate, creating an apparent anomaly unrelated to the filling distribution itself.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「水位上升與空間均勻」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Level rise and spatial uniformity\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["感測器位在節點可能看不到明顯振盪，平均上升率正確仍可能有船端受力。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","閥門開度固定時流量就不受兩側水頭差變化影響。"],"optionsEn":["A sensor near a modal node may miss oscillation even when vessel-end forces are significant.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A fixed valve opening makes flow independent of the changing head difference."],"answer":0,"explanation":"感測器位在節點可能看不到明顯振盪，平均上升率正確仍可能有船端受力。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A sensor near a modal node may miss oscillation even when vessel-end forces are significant. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b292-v15-13","title":"孔口水頭流量：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Orifice head-discharge relation: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「孔口水頭流量」如何影響大型船閘灌排水系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Orifice head-discharge relation” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Filling and emptying systems for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"閥口和孔口將水頭轉成流速，縮流及損失由流量係數近似。固定開口準定常公式忽略廊道加速度與水頭快速變化，局部係數又受開度和雷諾數影響；實際灌排需追蹤上游水位、閘內水位及開度歷程，不能只以初始最大水頭推全程。 假設固定孔口Cd=0.70、面積8m²、瞬時水頭差5m，Q=CdA√(2gH)=55.465m³/s；準定常示意。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「孔口水頭流量」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An opening converts head into flow, with a discharge coefficient approximating contraction and losses. A fixed-opening quasi-steady relation omits culvert acceleration and rapid head variation, while coefficient depends on opening and flow regime. Actual filling must track upper level, chamber level and valve position through time rather than extending the maximum initial head over the whole cycle. Assume fixed opening Cd=0.70,area8m² and instantaneous head difference5m. Quasi-steady Q=CdA√(2gH)=55.465m³/s, excluding acceleration effects. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Orifice head-discharge relation” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「閥門開度固定時流量就不受兩側水頭差變化影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A fixed valve opening makes flow independent of the changing head difference.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「孔口水頭流量」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Orifice head-discharge relation”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-13-k1","title":"孔口水頭流量","titleEn":"Orifice head-discharge relation","text":"閥口和孔口將水頭轉成流速，縮流及損失由流量係數近似。固定開口準定常公式忽略廊道加速度與水頭快速變化，局部係數又受開度和雷諾數影響；實際灌排需追蹤上游水位、閘內水位及開度歷程，不能只以初始最大水頭推全程。","textEn":"An opening converts head into flow, with a discharge coefficient approximating contraction and losses. A fixed-opening quasi-steady relation omits culvert acceleration and rapid head variation, while coefficient depends on opening and flow regime.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：閥門開度固定時流量就不受兩側水頭差變化影響。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A fixed valve opening makes flow independent of the changing head difference. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「孔口水頭流量」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Orifice head-discharge relation\" is correct?","options":["閥門開度固定時流量就不受兩側水頭差變化影響。","閥口和孔口將水頭轉成流速，縮流及損失由流量係數近似。","只要某一瞬間兩側水位相等就代表後續不會再有壓差。"],"optionsEn":["A fixed valve opening makes flow independent of the changing head difference.","An opening converts head into flow, with a discharge coefficient approximating contraction and losses.","One instant of equal levels proves that no pressure difference can develop afterward."],"answer":1,"explanation":"閥口和孔口將水頭轉成流速，縮流及損失由流量係數近似。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An opening converts head into flow, with a discharge coefficient approximating contraction and losses. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b292-v15-14","title":"孔口水頭流量：定量估算","titleEn":"Orifice head-discharge relation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「孔口水頭流量」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Orifice head-discharge relation” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設固定孔口Cd=0.70、面積8m²、瞬時水頭差5m，Q=CdA√(2gH)=55.465m³/s；準定常示意。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume fixed opening Cd=0.70,area8m² and instantaneous head difference5m. Quasi-steady Q=CdA√(2gH)=55.465m³/s, excluding acceleration effects. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對孔口面積是否對應實際開度，同步比較兩側總水頭與流量，辨識係數在不同階段是否改變。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check that opening area matches actual position and compare simultaneous heads and discharge, identifying coefficient changes through the cycle.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設固定孔口Cd=0.70、面積8m²、瞬時水頭差5m，Q=CdA√(2gH)=55.465m³/s；準定常示意。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume fixed opening Cd=0.70,area8m² and instantaneous head difference5m. Quasi-steady Q=CdA√(2gH)=55.465m³/s, excluding acceleration effects.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「孔口水頭流量」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Orifice head-discharge relation\", which statement holds?","options":["灌水射流的全部動量反力都必定直接施加在閘內船舶上。","壓力計顯示正表壓就可以排除閥內所有局部空化現象。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["The entire filling-jet momentum reaction necessarily acts directly on the vessel in the chamber.","Positive gauge pressure at one sensor rules out all local cavitation inside the valve.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b292-v15-15","title":"孔口水頭流量：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Orifice head-discharge relation: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「孔口水頭流量」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Orifice head-discharge relation” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對孔口面積是否對應實際開度，同步比較兩側總水頭與流量，辨識係數在不同階段是否改變。將啟動和接近平水的區段分開驗證，不用單一校正點宣稱全時程適用。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check that opening area matches actual position and compare simultaneous heads and discharge, identifying coefficient changes through the cycle. Validate startup and near-equalization separately rather than claiming complete hydrograph applicability from one conveniently matched calibration point. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：核對孔口面積是否對應實際開度，同步比較兩側總水頭與流量，辨識係數在不同階段是否改變。將啟動和接近平水的區段分開驗證，不用單一校正點宣稱全時程適用。","observationEn":"Site practice: Check that opening area matches actual position and compare simultaneous heads and discharge, identifying coefficient changes through the cycle. Validate startup and near-equalization separately rather than claiming complete hydrograph applicability from one conveniently matched calibration point.","failure":"注意干擾：開度相同而上游水頭不同會產生不同流量，廊道慣性又可能讓流量落後於水頭。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Equal opening with different upstream head gives different discharge, and culvert inertia can delay the response. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對孔口面積是否對應實際開度，同步比較兩側總水頭與流量，辨識係數在不同階段是否改變。將啟動和接近平水的區段分開驗證，不用單一校正點宣稱全時程適用。","textEn":"Check that opening area matches actual position and compare simultaneous heads and discharge, identifying coefficient changes through the cycle. Validate startup and near-equalization separately rather than claiming complete hydrograph applicability from one conveniently matched calibration point.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"核對孔口面積是否對應實際開度，同步比較兩側總水頭與流量，辨識係數在不同階段是否改變。將啟動和接近平水的區段分開驗證，不用單一校正點宣稱全時程適用。","textEn":"Check that opening area matches actual position and compare simultaneous heads and discharge, identifying coefficient changes through the cycle. Validate startup and near-equalization separately rather than claiming complete hydrograph applicability from one conveniently matched calibration point.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「孔口水頭流量」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Orifice head-discharge relation\"?","options":["核對孔口面積是否對應實際開度，同步比較兩側總水頭與流量，辨識係數在不同階段是否改變。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","閘室全部容積就是每次通航必須重新消耗的淡水量。"],"optionsEn":["Check that opening area matches actual position and compare simultaneous heads and discharge, identifying coefficient changes through the cycle.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","The entire chamber volume is fresh water that must be consumed anew on every transit."],"answer":0,"explanation":"核對孔口面積是否對應實際開度，同步比較兩側總水頭與流量，辨識係數在不同階段是否改變。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check that opening area matches actual position and compare simultaneous heads and discharge, identifying coefficient changes through the cycle. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b292-v15-16","title":"孔口水頭流量：失效診斷","titleEn":"Orifice head-discharge relation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「孔口水頭流量」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Orifice head-discharge relation” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"開度相同而上游水頭不同會產生不同流量，廊道慣性又可能讓流量落後於水頭。沿用固定係數湊合資料，可能掩蓋閥口損傷或旁通流路改變。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Equal opening with different upstream head gives different discharge, and culvert inertia can delay the response. Tuning one fixed coefficient to fit observations may conceal damaged openings or changes in bypass paths through the system. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設固定孔口Cd=0.70、面積8m²、瞬時水頭差5m，Q=CdA√(2gH)=55.465m³/s；準定常示意。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Quasi-steady Q=CdA√(2gH)=55.465m³/s, excluding acceleration effects.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「閥門開度固定時流量就不受兩側水頭差變化影響。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A fixed valve opening makes flow independent of the changing head difference.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"開度相同而上游水頭不同會產生不同流量，廊道慣性又可能讓流量落後於水頭。沿用固定係數湊合資料，可能掩蓋閥口損傷或旁通流路改變。","textEn":"Equal opening with different upstream head gives different discharge, and culvert inertia can delay the response. Tuning one fixed coefficient to fit observations may conceal damaged openings or changes in bypass paths through the system.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「孔口水頭流量」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Orifice head-discharge relation\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","開度相同而上游水頭不同會產生不同流量，廊道慣性又可能讓流量落後於水頭。","只要某一瞬間兩側水位相等就代表後續不會再有壓差。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Equal opening with different upstream head gives different discharge, and culvert inertia can delay the response.","One instant of equal levels proves that no pressure difference can develop afterward."],"answer":1,"explanation":"開度相同而上游水頭不同會產生不同流量，廊道慣性又可能讓流量落後於水頭。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Equal opening with different upstream head gives different discharge, and culvert inertia can delay the response. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b292-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「平水末段時間」與「廊道局部水頭損失」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Late-stage equalization time\" and \"Local culvert head losses\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b292-v15-17","title":"平水末段時間：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Late-stage equalization time: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「平水末段時間」如何影響大型船閘灌排水系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Late-stage equalization time” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Filling and emptying systems for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"閘內水位接近上游時水頭衰減，最後一段升水通常比簡單線性外推慢。固定上游庫、固定孔口且無慣性的積分模型可以顯示平方根關係，真實末段還有振盪、漏水及控制判定；剩餘水頭門檻只是數學終點，不是開門或通航條件。 假設Ac=9000m²、Cd=0.70、孔口8m²、固定上游，水頭由10降0.1m，t=2Ac(√10−√0.1)/(CdA√2g)=2065.3s。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「平水末段時間」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"As the chamber approaches the upper level, declining head slows the final rise compared with a linear extrapolation. Integration for a fixed reservoir and opening without inertia reveals the square-root relation. Actual late-stage behavior includes oscillation, leakage and control decisions; a residual-head endpoint in this model is mathematical only, not a gate-opening or transit criterion. Assume chamber area9000m²,Cd=0.70,opening8m² and fixed upper level. Reducing head10to0.1m gives t=2Ac(√10−√0.1)/(CdA√2g)=2065.3s. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Late-stage equalization time” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要某一瞬間兩側水位相等就代表後續不會再有壓差。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"One instant of equal levels proves that no pressure difference can develop afterward.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「平水末段時間」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Late-stage equalization time”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-17-k1","title":"平水末段時間","titleEn":"Late-stage equalization time","text":"閘內水位接近上游時水頭衰減，最後一段升水通常比簡單線性外推慢。固定上游庫、固定孔口且無慣性的積分模型可以顯示平方根關係，真實末段還有振盪、漏水及控制判定；剩餘水頭門檻只是數學終點，不是開門或通航條件。","textEn":"As the chamber approaches the upper level, declining head slows the final rise compared with a linear extrapolation. Integration for a fixed reservoir and opening without inertia reveals the square-root relation.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要某一瞬間兩側水位相等就代表後續不會再有壓差。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: One instant of equal levels proves that no pressure difference can develop afterward. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「平水末段時間」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Late-stage equalization time\" is correct?","options":["只要某一瞬間兩側水位相等就代表後續不會再有壓差。","廊道總水頭損失較小就保證船閘內水流一定更均勻。","閘內水位接近上游時水頭衰減，最後一段升水通常比簡單線性外推慢。"],"optionsEn":["One instant of equal levels proves that no pressure difference can develop afterward.","Lower total culvert head loss guarantees a more uniform flow field inside the lock.","As the chamber approaches the upper level, declining head slows the final rise compared with a linear extrapolation."],"answer":2,"explanation":"閘內水位接近上游時水頭衰減，最後一段升水通常比簡單線性外推慢。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"As the chamber approaches the upper level, declining head slows the final rise compared with a linear extrapolation. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b292-v15-18","title":"平水末段時間：定量估算","titleEn":"Late-stage equalization time: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「平水末段時間」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Late-stage equalization time” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設Ac=9000m²、Cd=0.70、孔口8m²、固定上游，水頭由10降0.1m，t=2Ac(√10−√0.1)/(CdA√2g)=2065.3s。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume chamber area9000m²,Cd=0.70,opening8m² and fixed upper level. Reducing head10to0.1m gives t=2Ac(√10−√0.1)/(CdA√2g)=2065.3s. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：明列上游是否可當固定水位及孔口是否全程不變，將水頭平方根對時間作圖檢查近似。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: State whether upper level and opening remain fixed and plot square-root head against time to test the approximation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設Ac=9000m²、Cd=0.70、孔口8m²、固定上游，水頭由10降0.1m，t=2Ac(√10−√0.1)/(CdA√2g)=2065.3s。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume chamber area9000m²,Cd=0.70,opening8m² and fixed upper level. Reducing head10to0.1m gives t=2Ac(√10−√0.1)/(CdA√2g)=2065.3s.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「平水末段時間」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Late-stage equalization time\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","任何速度變化無論多慢都會產生相同的焦可夫斯基峰值水錘。","船舶所有繫纜力都可由兩端水位差單獨精確決定。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","Every velocity change produces the same Joukowsky peak regardless of how slowly it occurs.","The complete vessel mooring force is exactly determined by end-to-end level difference alone."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b292-v15-19","title":"平水末段時間：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Late-stage equalization time: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「平水末段時間」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Late-stage equalization time” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"明列上游是否可當固定水位及孔口是否全程不變，將水頭平方根對時間作圖檢查近似。保存末段振盪和測量解析度，另由正式系統要求判定平水條件，不以本算例終點操作閘門。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"State whether upper level and opening remain fixed and plot square-root head against time to test the approximation. Retain late oscillation and measurement resolution, leaving equalization criteria to the approved system rather than using this illustrative endpoint to operate a gate. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：明列上游是否可當固定水位及孔口是否全程不變，將水頭平方根對時間作圖檢查近似。保存末段振盪和測量解析度，另由正式系統要求判定平水條件，不以本算例終點操作閘門。","observationEn":"Site practice: State whether upper level and opening remain fixed and plot square-root head against time to test the approximation. Retain late oscillation and measurement resolution, leaving equalization criteria to the approved system rather than using this illustrative endpoint to operate a gate.","failure":"注意干擾：上游庫面積有限時兩側都會變位，套固定庫模型會算錯時間；末段壓力振盪則可能使瞬間水位相等後再次分離。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: With finite upper storage, both levels move and the fixed-reservoir estimate becomes inaccurate. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"明列上游是否可當固定水位及孔口是否全程不變，將水頭平方根對時間作圖檢查近似。保存末段振盪和測量解析度，另由正式系統要求判定平水條件，不以本算例終點操作閘門。","textEn":"State whether upper level and opening remain fixed and plot square-root head against time to test the approximation. Retain late oscillation and measurement resolution, leaving equalization criteria to the approved system rather than using this illustrative endpoint to operate a gate.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"明列上游是否可當固定水位及孔口是否全程不變，將水頭平方根對時間作圖檢查近似。保存末段振盪和測量解析度，另由正式系統要求判定平水條件，不以本算例終點操作閘門。","textEn":"State whether upper level and opening remain fixed and plot square-root head against time to test the approximation. Retain late oscillation and measurement resolution, leaving equalization criteria to the approved system rather than using this illustrative endpoint to operate a gate.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「平水末段時間」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Late-stage equalization time\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","明列上游是否可當固定水位及孔口是否全程不變，將水頭平方根對時間作圖檢查近似。","峰值流量除以總水量即可準確代表整個灌排所需時間。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","State whether upper level and opening remain fixed and plot square-root head against time to test the approximation.","Peak discharge alone provides an accurate filling duration for the complete chamber volume."],"answer":1,"explanation":"明列上游是否可當固定水位及孔口是否全程不變，將水頭平方根對時間作圖檢查近似。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"State whether upper level and opening remain fixed and plot square-root head against time to test the approximation. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b292-v15-20","title":"平水末段時間：失效診斷","titleEn":"Late-stage equalization time: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「平水末段時間」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Late-stage equalization time” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"上游庫面積有限時兩側都會變位，套固定庫模型會算錯時間；末段壓力振盪則可能使瞬間水位相等後再次分離。只檢查一刻讀值，無法證明持續平衡。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"With finite upper storage, both levels move and the fixed-reservoir estimate becomes inaccurate. Late pressure oscillations can also separate levels again after a momentary match, so one equal reading does not establish sustained hydraulic balance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設Ac=9000m²、Cd=0.70、孔口8m²、固定上游，水頭由10降0.1m，t=2Ac(√10−√0.1)/(CdA√2g)=2065.3s。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Reducing head10to0.1m gives t=2Ac(√10−√0.1)/(CdA√2g)=2065.3s.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要某一瞬間兩側水位相等就代表後續不會再有壓差。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"One instant of equal levels proves that no pressure difference can develop afterward.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"上游庫面積有限時兩側都會變位，套固定庫模型會算錯時間；末段壓力振盪則可能使瞬間水位相等後再次分離。只檢查一刻讀值，無法證明持續平衡。","textEn":"With finite upper storage, both levels move and the fixed-reservoir estimate becomes inaccurate. Late pressure oscillations can also separate levels again after a momentary match, so one equal reading does not establish sustained hydraulic balance.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「平水末段時間」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Late-stage equalization time\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","廊道總水頭損失較小就保證船閘內水流一定更均勻。","上游庫面積有限時兩側都會變位，套固定庫模型會算錯時間；末段壓力振盪則可能使瞬間水位相等後再次分離。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Lower total culvert head loss guarantees a more uniform flow field inside the lock.","With finite upper storage, both levels move and the fixed-reservoir estimate becomes inaccurate."],"answer":2,"explanation":"上游庫面積有限時兩側都會變位，套固定庫模型會算錯時間；末段壓力振盪則可能使瞬間水位相等後再次分離。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"With finite upper storage, both levels move and the fixed-reservoir estimate becomes inaccurate. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b292-v15-21","title":"廊道局部水頭損失：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Local culvert head losses: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「廊道局部水頭損失」如何影響大型船閘灌排水系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Local culvert head losses” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Filling and emptying systems for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"彎道、分岔和閥件將能量耗散成紊流，局部損失係數需指定參考速度。把不同截面速度下的係數直接相加會失去一致性，且閥門位置隨時間改變；低損失不一定代表閘內流場較均勻，流量分配和射流方向仍要另行檢驗。 假設同一參考流速v=4m/s、局部總係數K=3，hL=Kv²/(2g)=2.446m；只合併同速度基準的損失。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「廊道局部水頭損失」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Bends, junctions and valves dissipate energy through turbulence, with each coefficient tied to a reference velocity. Adding coefficients based on different areas is inconsistent, and valve position changes through time. Low total loss does not necessarily produce more uniform chamber flow; distribution and jet direction require separate assessment rather than being inferred from an apparently efficient hydraulic path. Assume common reference velocity4m/s and total local coefficient K=3. hL=Kv²/(2g)=2.446m, combining only coefficients on that velocity basis. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Local culvert head losses” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「廊道總水頭損失較小就保證船閘內水流一定更均勻。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Lower total culvert head loss guarantees a more uniform flow field inside the lock.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「廊道局部水頭損失」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Local culvert head losses”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-21-k1","title":"廊道局部水頭損失","titleEn":"Local culvert head losses","text":"彎道、分岔和閥件將能量耗散成紊流，局部損失係數需指定參考速度。把不同截面速度下的係數直接相加會失去一致性，且閥門位置隨時間改變；低損失不一定代表閘內流場較均勻，流量分配和射流方向仍要另行檢驗。","textEn":"Bends, junctions and valves dissipate energy through turbulence, with each coefficient tied to a reference velocity. Adding coefficients based on different areas is inconsistent, and valve position changes through time.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：廊道總水頭損失較小就保證船閘內水流一定更均勻。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Lower total culvert head loss guarantees a more uniform flow field inside the lock. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「廊道局部水頭損失」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Local culvert head losses\" is correct?","options":["彎道、分岔和閥件將能量耗散成紊流，局部損失係數需指定參考速度。","廊道總水頭損失較小就保證船閘內水流一定更均勻。","灌水射流的全部動量反力都必定直接施加在閘內船舶上。"],"optionsEn":["Bends, junctions and valves dissipate energy through turbulence, with each coefficient tied to a reference velocity.","Lower total culvert head loss guarantees a more uniform flow field inside the lock.","The entire filling-jet momentum reaction necessarily acts directly on the vessel in the chamber."],"answer":0,"explanation":"彎道、分岔和閥件將能量耗散成紊流，局部損失係數需指定參考速度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Bends, junctions and valves dissipate energy through turbulence, with each coefficient tied to a reference velocity. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b292-v15-22","title":"廊道局部水頭損失：定量估算","titleEn":"Local culvert head losses: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「廊道局部水頭損失」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Local culvert head losses” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設同一參考流速v=4m/s、局部總係數K=3，hL=Kv²/(2g)=2.446m；只合併同速度基準的損失。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume common reference velocity4m/s and total local coefficient K=3. hL=Kv²/(2g)=2.446m, combining only coefficients on that velocity basis. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：對每個彎頭分岔標示截面與參考速度，將係數轉至共同基準後再合計，並核對壓力測點位置。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Label area and reference velocity at each fitting and convert coefficients to one basis before summing, checking pressure-tap positions.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設同一參考流速v=4m/s、局部總係數K=3，hL=Kv²/(2g)=2.446m；只合併同速度基準的損失。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume common reference velocity4m/s and total local coefficient K=3. hL=Kv²/(2g)=2.446m, combining only coefficients on that velocity basis.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「廊道局部水頭損失」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Local culvert head losses\", which statement holds?","options":["壓力計顯示正表壓就可以排除閥內所有局部空化現象。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","閘室全部容積就是每次通航必須重新消耗的淡水量。"],"optionsEn":["Positive gauge pressure at one sensor rules out all local cavitation inside the valve.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","The entire chamber volume is fresh water that must be consumed anew on every transit."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b292-v15-23","title":"廊道局部水頭損失：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Local culvert head losses: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「廊道局部水頭損失」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Local culvert head losses” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"對每個彎頭分岔標示截面與參考速度，將係數轉至共同基準後再合計，並核對壓力測點位置。比較各支路流量和閘內水面，不把較小總壓降直接解讀為較小船舶受力。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Label area and reference velocity at each fitting and convert coefficients to one basis before summing, checking pressure-tap positions. Compare branch flows and chamber surface response rather than interpreting lower total pressure loss directly as reduced vessel loading during filling. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：對每個彎頭分岔標示截面與參考速度，將係數轉至共同基準後再合計，並核對壓力測點位置。比較各支路流量和閘內水面，不把較小總壓降直接解讀為較小船舶受力。","observationEn":"Site practice: Label area and reference velocity at each fitting and convert coefficients to one basis before summing, checking pressure-tap positions. Compare branch flows and chamber surface response rather than interpreting lower total pressure loss directly as reduced vessel loading during filling.","failure":"注意干擾：廊道局部縮頸會提高速度，原係數基準不改便低估損失。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A local constriction raises velocity, and retaining the wrong coefficient basis understates loss. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對每個彎頭分岔標示截面與參考速度，將係數轉至共同基準後再合計，並核對壓力測點位置。比較各支路流量和閘內水面，不把較小總壓降直接解讀為較小船舶受力。","textEn":"Label area and reference velocity at each fitting and convert coefficients to one basis before summing, checking pressure-tap positions. Compare branch flows and chamber surface response rather than interpreting lower total pressure loss directly as reduced vessel loading during filling.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"對每個彎頭分岔標示截面與參考速度，將係數轉至共同基準後再合計，並核對壓力測點位置。比較各支路流量和閘內水面，不把較小總壓降直接解讀為較小船舶受力。","textEn":"Label area and reference velocity at each fitting and convert coefficients to one basis before summing, checking pressure-tap positions. Compare branch flows and chamber surface response rather than interpreting lower total pressure loss directly as reduced vessel loading during filling.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「廊道局部水頭損失」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Local culvert head losses\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","平均水位上升率穩定就證明閘室所有位置都沒有水面振盪。","對每個彎頭分岔標示截面與參考速度，將係數轉至共同基準後再合計，並核對壓力測點位置。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","A steady mean rise proves that no surface oscillation exists anywhere in the chamber.","Label area and reference velocity at each fitting and convert coefficients to one basis before summing, checking pressure-tap positions."],"answer":2,"explanation":"對每個彎頭分岔標示截面與參考速度，將係數轉至共同基準後再合計，並核對壓力測點位置。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Label area and reference velocity at each fitting and convert coefficients to one basis before summing, checking pressure-tap positions. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b292-v15-24","title":"廊道局部水頭損失：失效診斷","titleEn":"Local culvert head losses: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「廊道局部水頭損失」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Local culvert head losses” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"廊道局部縮頸會提高速度，原係數基準不改便低估損失。分岔左右阻力不均可能讓水流偏向一側，即使總流量合計正確仍會產生不均勻水面和繫纜需求。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A local constriction raises velocity, and retaining the wrong coefficient basis understates loss. Unequal branch resistance directs flow to one side, producing nonuniform surface response and mooring demand even when total discharge is correctly predicted. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設同一參考流速v=4m/s、局部總係數K=3，hL=Kv²/(2g)=2.446m；只合併同速度基準的損失。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Assume common reference velocity4m/s and total local coefficient K=3. hL=Kv²/(2g)=2.446m, combining only coefficients on that velocity basis.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「廊道總水頭損失較小就保證船閘內水流一定更均勻。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Lower total culvert head loss guarantees a more uniform flow field inside the lock.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"廊道局部縮頸會提高速度，原係數基準不改便低估損失。分岔左右阻力不均可能讓水流偏向一側，即使總流量合計正確仍會產生不均勻水面和繫纜需求。","textEn":"A local constriction raises velocity, and retaining the wrong coefficient basis understates loss. Unequal branch resistance directs flow to one side, producing nonuniform surface response and mooring demand even when total discharge is correctly predicted.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「廊道局部水頭損失」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Local culvert head losses\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["廊道局部縮頸會提高速度，原係數基準不改便低估損失。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","灌水射流的全部動量反力都必定直接施加在閘內船舶上。"],"optionsEn":["A local constriction raises velocity, and retaining the wrong coefficient basis understates loss.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","The entire filling-jet momentum reaction necessarily acts directly on the vessel in the chamber."],"answer":0,"explanation":"廊道局部縮頸會提高速度，原係數基準不改便低估損失。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A local constriction raises velocity, and retaining the wrong coefficient basis understates loss. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b292-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「射流動量與導流」與「快速變速與水錘」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Jet momentum and redirection\" and \"Rapid velocity change and water hammer\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b292-v15-25","title":"射流動量與導流：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Jet momentum and redirection: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「射流動量與導流」如何影響大型船閘灌排水系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Jet momentum and redirection” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Filling and emptying systems for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"灌水射流的動量需要由導流板、周邊水體和結構共同改變，控制體收支可估合力尺度。完全停止指定方向速度只是一種邊界，實際射流會擴散及偏轉；這個反力不能直接當成船體承受的荷載，船位、湍流與水面坡度還有其他傳力路徑。 假設淡水ρ=1000kg/m³、Q=20m³/s、入口水平v=4m/s，出口該方向速度為0且忽略壓力差，反力ρQv=80kN。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「射流動量與導流」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Filling-jet momentum is redirected by diffusers, surrounding water and structure. A control-volume balance provides a resultant scale, with complete stopping in one direction only a chosen boundary. Real jets spread and turn, so this reaction is not automatically the vessel load; vessel location, turbulence and surface gradients introduce additional transfer paths that need their own observations and models. Assume freshwater1000kg/m³,Q=20m³/s,inlet horizontal speed4m/s and zero outlet component, neglecting pressure differences. Momentum reaction is80kN, not vessel force. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Jet momentum and redirection” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「灌水射流的全部動量反力都必定直接施加在閘內船舶上。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The entire filling-jet momentum reaction necessarily acts directly on the vessel in the chamber.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「射流動量與導流」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Jet momentum and redirection”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-25-k1","title":"射流動量與導流","titleEn":"Jet momentum and redirection","text":"灌水射流的動量需要由導流板、周邊水體和結構共同改變，控制體收支可估合力尺度。完全停止指定方向速度只是一種邊界，實際射流會擴散及偏轉；這個反力不能直接當成船體承受的荷載，船位、湍流與水面坡度還有其他傳力路徑。","textEn":"Filling-jet momentum is redirected by diffusers, surrounding water and structure. A control-volume balance provides a resultant scale, with complete stopping in one direction only a chosen boundary.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：灌水射流的全部動量反力都必定直接施加在閘內船舶上。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The entire filling-jet momentum reaction necessarily acts directly on the vessel in the chamber. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「射流動量與導流」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Jet momentum and redirection\" is correct?","options":["灌水射流的全部動量反力都必定直接施加在閘內船舶上。","灌水射流的動量需要由導流板、周邊水體和結構共同改變，控制體收支可估合力尺度。","任何速度變化無論多慢都會產生相同的焦可夫斯基峰值水錘。"],"optionsEn":["The entire filling-jet momentum reaction necessarily acts directly on the vessel in the chamber.","Filling-jet momentum is redirected by diffusers, surrounding water and structure.","Every velocity change produces the same Joukowsky peak regardless of how slowly it occurs."],"answer":1,"explanation":"灌水射流的動量需要由導流板、周邊水體和結構共同改變，控制體收支可估合力尺度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Filling-jet momentum is redirected by diffusers, surrounding water and structure. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b292-v15-26","title":"射流動量與導流：定量估算","titleEn":"Jet momentum and redirection: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「射流動量與導流」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Jet momentum and redirection” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設淡水ρ=1000kg/m³、Q=20m³/s、入口水平v=4m/s，出口該方向速度為0且忽略壓力差，反力ρQv=80kN。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume freshwater1000kg/m³,Q=20m³/s,inlet horizontal speed4m/s and zero outlet component, neglecting pressure differences. Momentum reaction is80kN, not vessel force. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：畫控制體的入口出口和壓力面，核對速度向量而不只用速率，檢查有無其他支流。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Draw control-volume boundaries and pressure faces, using velocity vectors rather than speed alone and checking side flows.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設淡水ρ=1000kg/m³、Q=20m³/s、入口水平v=4m/s，出口該方向速度為0且忽略壓力差，反力ρQv=80kN。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume freshwater1000kg/m³,Q=20m³/s,inlet horizontal speed4m/s and zero outlet component, neglecting pressure differences. Momentum reaction is80kN, not vessel force.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「射流動量與導流」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Jet momentum and redirection\", which statement holds?","options":["船舶所有繫纜力都可由兩端水位差單獨精確決定。","峰值流量除以總水量即可準確代表整個灌排所需時間。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["The complete vessel mooring force is exactly determined by end-to-end level difference alone.","Peak discharge alone provides an accurate filling duration for the complete chamber volume.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b292-v15-27","title":"射流動量與導流：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Jet momentum and redirection: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「射流動量與導流」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Jet momentum and redirection” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"畫控制體的入口出口和壓力面，核對速度向量而不只用速率，檢查有無其他支流。以導流區壓力與流速資料測試動量收支，另量船舶受力，避免把兩者視為同一量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Draw control-volume boundaries and pressure faces, using velocity vectors rather than speed alone and checking side flows. Test momentum balance with diffuser-area measurements and observe vessel force separately, avoiding the assumption that these two distinct resultants must coincide. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：畫控制體的入口出口和壓力面，核對速度向量而不只用速率，檢查有無其他支流。以導流區壓力與流速資料測試動量收支，另量船舶受力，避免把兩者視為同一量。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw control-volume boundaries and pressure faces, using velocity vectors rather than speed alone and checking side flows. Test momentum balance with diffuser-area measurements and observe vessel force separately, avoiding the assumption that these two distinct resultants must coincide.","failure":"注意干擾：射流轉向卻被當成完全停止會算錯反力方向，漏掉出口壓力又使合力不閉合。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Treating a turned jet as fully stopped misstates reaction direction, while omitted outlet pressure breaks the force balance. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"畫控制體的入口出口和壓力面，核對速度向量而不只用速率，檢查有無其他支流。以導流區壓力與流速資料測試動量收支，另量船舶受力，避免把兩者視為同一量。","textEn":"Draw control-volume boundaries and pressure faces, using velocity vectors rather than speed alone and checking side flows. Test momentum balance with diffuser-area measurements and observe vessel force separately, avoiding the assumption that these two distinct resultants must coincide.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"畫控制體的入口出口和壓力面，核對速度向量而不只用速率，檢查有無其他支流。以導流區壓力與流速資料測試動量收支，另量船舶受力，避免把兩者視為同一量。","textEn":"Draw control-volume boundaries and pressure faces, using velocity vectors rather than speed alone and checking side flows. Test momentum balance with diffuser-area measurements and observe vessel force separately, avoiding the assumption that these two distinct resultants must coincide.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「射流動量與導流」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Jet momentum and redirection\"?","options":["畫控制體的入口出口和壓力面，核對速度向量而不只用速率，檢查有無其他支流。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","閥門開度固定時流量就不受兩側水頭差變化影響。"],"optionsEn":["Draw control-volume boundaries and pressure faces, using velocity vectors rather than speed alone and checking side flows.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A fixed valve opening makes flow independent of the changing head difference."],"answer":0,"explanation":"畫控制體的入口出口和壓力面，核對速度向量而不只用速率，檢查有無其他支流。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Draw control-volume boundaries and pressure faces, using velocity vectors rather than speed alone and checking side flows. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b292-v15-28","title":"射流動量與導流：失效診斷","titleEn":"Jet momentum and redirection: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「射流動量與導流」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Jet momentum and redirection” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"射流轉向卻被當成完全停止會算錯反力方向，漏掉出口壓力又使合力不閉合。船體只截取部分流場時，直接套整股射流動量會錯估接觸作用。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Treating a turned jet as fully stopped misstates reaction direction, while omitted outlet pressure breaks the force balance. If a vessel intercepts only part of the flow, applying the entire jet momentum misrepresents its actual hydrodynamic demand. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設淡水ρ=1000kg/m³、Q=20m³/s、入口水平v=4m/s，出口該方向速度為0且忽略壓力差，反力ρQv=80kN。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Momentum reaction is80kN, not vessel force.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「灌水射流的全部動量反力都必定直接施加在閘內船舶上。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The entire filling-jet momentum reaction necessarily acts directly on the vessel in the chamber.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"射流轉向卻被當成完全停止會算錯反力方向，漏掉出口壓力又使合力不閉合。船體只截取部分流場時，直接套整股射流動量會錯估接觸作用。","textEn":"Treating a turned jet as fully stopped misstates reaction direction, while omitted outlet pressure breaks the force balance. If a vessel intercepts only part of the flow, applying the entire jet momentum misrepresents its actual hydrodynamic demand.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「射流動量與導流」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Jet momentum and redirection\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","射流轉向卻被當成完全停止會算錯反力方向，漏掉出口壓力又使合力不閉合。","任何速度變化無論多慢都會產生相同的焦可夫斯基峰值水錘。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Treating a turned jet as fully stopped misstates reaction direction, while omitted outlet pressure breaks the force balance.","Every velocity change produces the same Joukowsky peak regardless of how slowly it occurs."],"answer":1,"explanation":"射流轉向卻被當成完全停止會算錯反力方向，漏掉出口壓力又使合力不閉合。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Treating a turned jet as fully stopped misstates reaction direction, while omitted outlet pressure breaks the force balance. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b292-v15-29","title":"快速變速與水錘：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Rapid velocity change and water hammer: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「快速變速與水錘」如何影響大型船閘灌排水系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Rapid velocity change and water hammer” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Filling and emptying systems for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"廊道水柱快速變速會傳遞彈性壓力波，波速與管壁和含氣狀態相關。焦可夫斯基式適用相對往返波時間很快的速度改變，慢變化需考慮反射和水柱運動，不能將同一峰壓套所有啟閉時程；算式用來辨識機制，不提供實際閥門操作設定。 假設ρ=1000kg/m³、波速a=900m/s、Δv=1m/s，快速變速Δp=ρaΔv=900kPa；L=300m時須相對2L/a=0.667s很快。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「快速變速與水錘」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Rapid culvert-velocity changes propagate elastic pressure waves, with speed affected by wall flexibility and entrained air. The Joukowsky relation applies to changes rapid relative to wave round-trip time. Slower changes require reflections and water-column dynamics, so the same peak cannot be applied to every valve history; the example identifies a mechanism rather than prescribing actual valve operation. Assumeρ=1000kg/m³,a=900m/s,Δv=1m/s. Rapid-changeΔp=900kPa; for L=300m the change must be fast relative to2L/a=0.667s. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Rapid velocity change and water hammer” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「任何速度變化無論多慢都會產生相同的焦可夫斯基峰值水錘。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Every velocity change produces the same Joukowsky peak regardless of how slowly it occurs.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「快速變速與水錘」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Rapid velocity change and water hammer”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-29-k1","title":"快速變速與水錘","titleEn":"Rapid velocity change and water hammer","text":"廊道水柱快速變速會傳遞彈性壓力波，波速與管壁和含氣狀態相關。焦可夫斯基式適用相對往返波時間很快的速度改變，慢變化需考慮反射和水柱運動，不能將同一峰壓套所有啟閉時程；算式用來辨識機制，不提供實際閥門操作設定。","textEn":"Rapid culvert-velocity changes propagate elastic pressure waves, with speed affected by wall flexibility and entrained air. The Joukowsky relation applies to changes rapid relative to wave round-trip time.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：任何速度變化無論多慢都會產生相同的焦可夫斯基峰值水錘。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Every velocity change produces the same Joukowsky peak regardless of how slowly it occurs. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「快速變速與水錘」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Rapid velocity change and water hammer\" is correct?","options":["任何速度變化無論多慢都會產生相同的焦可夫斯基峰值水錘。","壓力計顯示正表壓就可以排除閥內所有局部空化現象。","廊道水柱快速變速會傳遞彈性壓力波，波速與管壁和含氣狀態相關。"],"optionsEn":["Every velocity change produces the same Joukowsky peak regardless of how slowly it occurs.","Positive gauge pressure at one sensor rules out all local cavitation inside the valve.","Rapid culvert-velocity changes propagate elastic pressure waves, with speed affected by wall flexibility and entrained air."],"answer":2,"explanation":"廊道水柱快速變速會傳遞彈性壓力波，波速與管壁和含氣狀態相關。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Rapid culvert-velocity changes propagate elastic pressure waves, with speed affected by wall flexibility and entrained air. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b292-v15-30","title":"快速變速與水錘：定量估算","titleEn":"Rapid velocity change and water hammer: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「快速變速與水錘」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Rapid velocity change and water hammer” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設ρ=1000kg/m³、波速a=900m/s、Δv=1m/s，快速變速Δp=ρaΔv=900kPa；L=300m時須相對2L/a=0.667s很快。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assumeρ=1000kg/m³,a=900m/s,Δv=1m/s. Rapid-changeΔp=900kPa; for L=300m the change must be fast relative to2L/a=0.667s. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對壓力感測頻寬和時間同步，將閥位、流速與壓力波到達時刻比較，明列有效波速來源。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check pressure-sensor bandwidth and synchronization, comparing valve position, velocity and wave-arrival times with a justified wave speed.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設ρ=1000kg/m³、波速a=900m/s、Δv=1m/s，快速變速Δp=ρaΔv=900kPa；L=300m時須相對2L/a=0.667s很快。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assumeρ=1000kg/m³,a=900m/s,Δv=1m/s. Rapid-changeΔp=900kPa; for L=300m the change must be fast relative to2L/a=0.667s.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「快速變速與水錘」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Rapid velocity change and water hammer\", which statement holds?","options":["教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","閘室全部容積就是每次通航必須重新消耗的淡水量。","平均水位上升率穩定就證明閘室所有位置都沒有水面振盪。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","The entire chamber volume is fresh water that must be consumed anew on every transit.","A steady mean rise proves that no surface oscillation exists anywhere in the chamber."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b292-v15-31","title":"快速變速與水錘：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Rapid velocity change and water hammer: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「快速變速與水錘」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rapid velocity change and water hammer” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對壓力感測頻寬和時間同步，將閥位、流速與壓力波到達時刻比較，明列有效波速來源。另檢查反射及低壓分離可能，不把單一理想增壓當成完整瞬變包絡。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check pressure-sensor bandwidth and synchronization, comparing valve position, velocity and wave-arrival times with a justified wave speed. Review reflections and possible low-pressure separation separately instead of treating one ideal pressure increase as a complete transient envelope for the system. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：核對壓力感測頻寬和時間同步，將閥位、流速與壓力波到達時刻比較，明列有效波速來源。另檢查反射及低壓分離可能，不把單一理想增壓當成完整瞬變包絡。","observationEn":"Site practice: Check pressure-sensor bandwidth and synchronization, comparing valve position, velocity and wave-arrival times with a justified wave speed. Review reflections and possible low-pressure separation separately instead of treating one ideal pressure increase as a complete transient envelope for the system.","failure":"注意干擾：感測器太慢會漏掉短壓力尖峰，含氣量改變又使波速偏離原假設。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Slow sensors miss brief pressure peaks, and changing air content alters assumed wave speed. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對壓力感測頻寬和時間同步，將閥位、流速與壓力波到達時刻比較，明列有效波速來源。另檢查反射及低壓分離可能，不把單一理想增壓當成完整瞬變包絡。","textEn":"Check pressure-sensor bandwidth and synchronization, comparing valve position, velocity and wave-arrival times with a justified wave speed. Review reflections and possible low-pressure separation separately instead of treating one ideal pressure increase as a complete transient envelope for the system.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"核對壓力感測頻寬和時間同步，將閥位、流速與壓力波到達時刻比較，明列有效波速來源。另檢查反射及低壓分離可能，不把單一理想增壓當成完整瞬變包絡。","textEn":"Check pressure-sensor bandwidth and synchronization, comparing valve position, velocity and wave-arrival times with a justified wave speed. Review reflections and possible low-pressure separation separately instead of treating one ideal pressure increase as a complete transient envelope for the system.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「快速變速與水錘」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Rapid velocity change and water hammer\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","核對壓力感測頻寬和時間同步，將閥位、流速與壓力波到達時刻比較，明列有效波速來源。","只要某一瞬間兩側水位相等就代表後續不會再有壓差。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Check pressure-sensor bandwidth and synchronization, comparing valve position, velocity and wave-arrival times with a justified wave speed.","One instant of equal levels proves that no pressure difference can develop afterward."],"answer":1,"explanation":"核對壓力感測頻寬和時間同步，將閥位、流速與壓力波到達時刻比較，明列有效波速來源。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check pressure-sensor bandwidth and synchronization, comparing valve position, velocity and wave-arrival times with a justified wave speed. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b292-v15-32","title":"快速變速與水錘：失效診斷","titleEn":"Rapid velocity change and water hammer: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「快速變速與水錘」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Rapid velocity change and water hammer” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"感測器太慢會漏掉短壓力尖峰，含氣量改變又使波速偏離原假設。只檢查最大正壓而忽略低壓區，可能漏掉分離後再接合造成的另一波衝擊。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Slow sensors miss brief pressure peaks, and changing air content alters assumed wave speed. Checking only positive maximum pressure overlooks separation at low pressure and another impact when the separated water column subsequently rejoins. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設ρ=1000kg/m³、波速a=900m/s、Δv=1m/s，快速變速Δp=ρaΔv=900kPa；L=300m時須相對2L/a=0.667s很快。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Rapid-changeΔp=900kPa; for L=300m the change must be fast relative to2L/a=0.667s.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「任何速度變化無論多慢都會產生相同的焦可夫斯基峰值水錘。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Every velocity change produces the same Joukowsky peak regardless of how slowly it occurs.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"感測器太慢會漏掉短壓力尖峰，含氣量改變又使波速偏離原假設。只檢查最大正壓而忽略低壓區，可能漏掉分離後再接合造成的另一波衝擊。","textEn":"Slow sensors miss brief pressure peaks, and changing air content alters assumed wave speed. Checking only positive maximum pressure overlooks separation at low pressure and another impact when the separated water column subsequently rejoins.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「快速變速與水錘」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Rapid velocity change and water hammer\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","壓力計顯示正表壓就可以排除閥內所有局部空化現象。","感測器太慢會漏掉短壓力尖峰，含氣量改變又使波速偏離原假設。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Positive gauge pressure at one sensor rules out all local cavitation inside the valve.","Slow sensors miss brief pressure peaks, and changing air content alters assumed wave speed."],"answer":2,"explanation":"感測器太慢會漏掉短壓力尖峰，含氣量改變又使波速偏離原假設。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Slow sensors miss brief pressure peaks, and changing air content alters assumed wave speed. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b292-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「絕對壓力與空化」與「水面坡度與繫泊需求」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Absolute pressure and cavitation\" and \"Surface gradient and mooring demand\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b292-v15-33","title":"絕對壓力與空化：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Absolute pressure and cavitation: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「絕對壓力與空化」如何影響大型船閘灌排水系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Absolute pressure and cavitation” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Filling and emptying systems for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"閥口高速區可能接近水的汽化壓力，空化指標需用絕對壓力而非表壓。指標是否低於危險門檻與形狀、粗糙及氣核有關，不能用通用數字自動判定；同樣平均壓力下局部低壓仍可不同，水溫也會改變汽化壓力。 假設絕對壓力80kPa、汽化壓2.3kPa、ρ=1000kg/m³、v=10m/s，σ=(p−pv)/(ρv²/2)=1.554；非通用允收界線。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「絕對壓力與空化」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"High-speed valve regions can approach vapor pressure, and cavitation indices require absolute rather than gauge pressure. A relevant onset threshold depends on geometry, roughness and nuclei, not a universal number. Identical mean pressures can conceal different local minima, while temperature changes vapor pressure; the index therefore supports comparison but does not alone establish absence of damaging cavitation. Assume absolute pressure80kPa,vapor pressure2.3kPa,ρ=1000kg/m³,v=10m/s. Cavitation indexσ=1.554, not a universal acceptance boundary. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Absolute pressure and cavitation” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「壓力計顯示正表壓就可以排除閥內所有局部空化現象。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Positive gauge pressure at one sensor rules out all local cavitation inside the valve.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「絕對壓力與空化」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Absolute pressure and cavitation”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-33-k1","title":"絕對壓力與空化","titleEn":"Absolute pressure and cavitation","text":"閥口高速區可能接近水的汽化壓力，空化指標需用絕對壓力而非表壓。指標是否低於危險門檻與形狀、粗糙及氣核有關，不能用通用數字自動判定；同樣平均壓力下局部低壓仍可不同，水溫也會改變汽化壓力。","textEn":"High-speed valve regions can approach vapor pressure, and cavitation indices require absolute rather than gauge pressure. A relevant onset threshold depends on geometry, roughness and nuclei, not a universal number.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：壓力計顯示正表壓就可以排除閥內所有局部空化現象。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Positive gauge pressure at one sensor rules out all local cavitation inside the valve. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「絕對壓力與空化」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Absolute pressure and cavitation\" is correct?","options":["閥口高速區可能接近水的汽化壓力，空化指標需用絕對壓力而非表壓。","壓力計顯示正表壓就可以排除閥內所有局部空化現象。","船舶所有繫纜力都可由兩端水位差單獨精確決定。"],"optionsEn":["High-speed valve regions can approach vapor pressure, and cavitation indices require absolute rather than gauge pressure.","Positive gauge pressure at one sensor rules out all local cavitation inside the valve.","The complete vessel mooring force is exactly determined by end-to-end level difference alone."],"answer":0,"explanation":"閥口高速區可能接近水的汽化壓力，空化指標需用絕對壓力而非表壓。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"High-speed valve regions can approach vapor pressure, and cavitation indices require absolute rather than gauge pressure. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b292-v15-34","title":"絕對壓力與空化：定量估算","titleEn":"Absolute pressure and cavitation: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「絕對壓力與空化」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Absolute pressure and cavitation” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設絕對壓力80kPa、汽化壓2.3kPa、ρ=1000kg/m³、v=10m/s，σ=(p−pv)/(ρv²/2)=1.554；非通用允收界線。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume absolute pressure80kPa,vapor pressure2.3kPa,ρ=1000kg/m³,v=10m/s. Cavitation indexσ=1.554, not a universal acceptance boundary. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：註明壓力儀使用表壓或絕對壓，核對溫度與汽化壓，檢查量測位置是否能代表局部低壓。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Identify gauge versus absolute readings, verify temperature and vapor pressure and assess whether taps capture local minima.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設絕對壓力80kPa、汽化壓2.3kPa、ρ=1000kg/m³、v=10m/s，σ=(p−pv)/(ρv²/2)=1.554；非通用允收界線。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume absolute pressure80kPa,vapor pressure2.3kPa,ρ=1000kg/m³,v=10m/s. Cavitation indexσ=1.554, not a universal acceptance boundary.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「絕對壓力與空化」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Absolute pressure and cavitation\", which statement holds?","options":["峰值流量除以總水量即可準確代表整個灌排所需時間。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","閥門開度固定時流量就不受兩側水頭差變化影響。"],"optionsEn":["Peak discharge alone provides an accurate filling duration for the complete chamber volume.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","A fixed valve opening makes flow independent of the changing head difference."],"answer":1,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b292-v15-35","title":"絕對壓力與空化：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Absolute pressure and cavitation: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「絕對壓力與空化」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Absolute pressure and cavitation” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"註明壓力儀使用表壓或絕對壓，核對溫度與汽化壓，檢查量測位置是否能代表局部低壓。比較聲學、振動與表面損傷證據，對照特定閥型資料，不以單一指標替代機制驗證。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Identify gauge versus absolute readings, verify temperature and vapor pressure and assess whether taps capture local minima. Compare acoustic, vibration and surface-damage evidence with data for the specific valve geometry rather than substituting one index for verification of the underlying mechanism. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：註明壓力儀使用表壓或絕對壓，核對溫度與汽化壓，檢查量測位置是否能代表局部低壓。比較聲學、振動與表面損傷證據，對照特定閥型資料，不以單一指標替代機制驗證。","observationEn":"Site practice: Identify gauge versus absolute readings, verify temperature and vapor pressure and assess whether taps capture local minima. Compare acoustic, vibration and surface-damage evidence with data for the specific valve geometry rather than substituting one index for verification of the underlying mechanism.","failure":"注意干擾：把表壓當絕對壓可能使指標錯一個大氣壓量級，遠離縮流區的壓力又會漏掉最不利位置。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using gauge pressure as absolute shifts the index by an atmospheric-pressure contribution, and distant taps miss the controlling constriction. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"註明壓力儀使用表壓或絕對壓，核對溫度與汽化壓，檢查量測位置是否能代表局部低壓。比較聲學、振動與表面損傷證據，對照特定閥型資料，不以單一指標替代機制驗證。","textEn":"Identify gauge versus absolute readings, verify temperature and vapor pressure and assess whether taps capture local minima. Compare acoustic, vibration and surface-damage evidence with data for the specific valve geometry rather than substituting one index for verification of the underlying mechanism.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"註明壓力儀使用表壓或絕對壓，核對溫度與汽化壓，檢查量測位置是否能代表局部低壓。比較聲學、振動與表面損傷證據，對照特定閥型資料，不以單一指標替代機制驗證。","textEn":"Identify gauge versus absolute readings, verify temperature and vapor pressure and assess whether taps capture local minima. Compare acoustic, vibration and surface-damage evidence with data for the specific valve geometry rather than substituting one index for verification of the underlying mechanism.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「絕對壓力與空化」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Absolute pressure and cavitation\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","廊道總水頭損失較小就保證船閘內水流一定更均勻。","註明壓力儀使用表壓或絕對壓，核對溫度與汽化壓，檢查量測位置是否能代表局部低壓。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Lower total culvert head loss guarantees a more uniform flow field inside the lock.","Identify gauge versus absolute readings, verify temperature and vapor pressure and assess whether taps capture local minima."],"answer":2,"explanation":"註明壓力儀使用表壓或絕對壓，核對溫度與汽化壓，檢查量測位置是否能代表局部低壓。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Identify gauge versus absolute readings, verify temperature and vapor pressure and assess whether taps capture local minima. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b292-v15-36","title":"絕對壓力與空化：失效診斷","titleEn":"Absolute pressure and cavitation: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「絕對壓力與空化」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Absolute pressure and cavitation” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把表壓當絕對壓可能使指標錯一個大氣壓量級，遠離縮流區的壓力又會漏掉最不利位置。尚未出現肉眼損傷也不代表沒有間歇空化。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using gauge pressure as absolute shifts the index by an atmospheric-pressure contribution, and distant taps miss the controlling constriction. Absence of visible erosion does not prove that intermittent cavitation is absent during part of the filling cycle. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設絕對壓力80kPa、汽化壓2.3kPa、ρ=1000kg/m³、v=10m/s，σ=(p−pv)/(ρv²/2)=1.554；非通用允收界線。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Cavitation indexσ=1.554, not a universal acceptance boundary.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「壓力計顯示正表壓就可以排除閥內所有局部空化現象。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Positive gauge pressure at one sensor rules out all local cavitation inside the valve.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把表壓當絕對壓可能使指標錯一個大氣壓量級，遠離縮流區的壓力又會漏掉最不利位置。尚未出現肉眼損傷也不代表沒有間歇空化。","textEn":"Using gauge pressure as absolute shifts the index by an atmospheric-pressure contribution, and distant taps miss the controlling constriction. Absence of visible erosion does not prove that intermittent cavitation is absent during part of the filling cycle.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「絕對壓力與空化」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Absolute pressure and cavitation\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["把表壓當絕對壓可能使指標錯一個大氣壓量級，遠離縮流區的壓力又會漏掉最不利位置。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","船舶所有繫纜力都可由兩端水位差單獨精確決定。"],"optionsEn":["Using gauge pressure as absolute shifts the index by an atmospheric-pressure contribution, and distant taps miss the controlling constriction.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","The complete vessel mooring force is exactly determined by end-to-end level difference alone."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把表壓當絕對壓可能使指標錯一個大氣壓量級，遠離縮流區的壓力又會漏掉最不利位置。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using gauge pressure as absolute shifts the index by an atmospheric-pressure contribution, and distant taps miss the controlling constriction. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b292-v15-37","title":"水面坡度與繫泊需求：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Surface gradient and mooring demand: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「水面坡度與繫泊需求」如何影響大型船閘灌排水系統的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Surface gradient and mooring demand” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Filling and emptying systems for navigation locks”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"長閘室水面坡度會對漂浮船舶形成沿坡方向的水力作用，與局部射流拖曳是不同機制。小坡度近似以排水重量乘坡度估量，但真實船型、流場和非定常加速度仍需另算；多點水位與船體運動的對時是檢驗這項機制的關鍵。 假設排水質量10000000kg、長波近靜水坡度Δη/L=0.05/200，F≈mgΔη/L=24.525kN；不含拖曳與船體加速度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「水面坡度與繫泊需求」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A longitudinal surface gradient creates a force on a floating vessel distinct from local jet drag. A small-gradient estimate uses displaced weight times slope, while hull geometry, currents and unsteady acceleration require separate treatment. Synchronized multi-point levels and vessel motion are essential for testing this mechanism, and the resulting scale is not a complete mooring-load envelope or line-setting instruction. Assume displaced mass10000000kg and long-wave quasi-hydrostatic slope0.05/200. F≈mgΔη/L=24.525kN, excluding drag and vessel acceleration. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Surface gradient and mooring demand” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits.","failure":"常見誤解：「船舶所有繫纜力都可由兩端水位差單獨精確決定。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The complete vessel mooring force is exactly determined by end-to-end level difference alone.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「水面坡度與繫泊需求」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Surface gradient and mooring demand”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-37-k1","title":"水面坡度與繫泊需求","titleEn":"Surface gradient and mooring demand","text":"長閘室水面坡度會對漂浮船舶形成沿坡方向的水力作用，與局部射流拖曳是不同機制。小坡度近似以排水重量乘坡度估量，但真實船型、流場和非定常加速度仍需另算；多點水位與船體運動的對時是檢驗這項機制的關鍵。","textEn":"A longitudinal surface gradient creates a force on a floating vessel distinct from local jet drag. A small-gradient estimate uses displaced weight times slope, while hull geometry, currents and unsteady acceleration require separate treatment.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：船舶所有繫纜力都可由兩端水位差單獨精確決定。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The complete vessel mooring force is exactly determined by end-to-end level difference alone. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「水面坡度與繫泊需求」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Surface gradient and mooring demand\" is correct?","options":["船舶所有繫纜力都可由兩端水位差單獨精確決定。","長閘室水面坡度會對漂浮船舶形成沿坡方向的水力作用，與局部射流拖曳是不同機制。","閘室全部容積就是每次通航必須重新消耗的淡水量。"],"optionsEn":["The complete vessel mooring force is exactly determined by end-to-end level difference alone.","A longitudinal surface gradient creates a force on a floating vessel distinct from local jet drag.","The entire chamber volume is fresh water that must be consumed anew on every transit."],"answer":1,"explanation":"長閘室水面坡度會對漂浮船舶形成沿坡方向的水力作用，與局部射流拖曳是不同機制。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A longitudinal surface gradient creates a force on a floating vessel distinct from local jet drag. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b292-v15-38","title":"水面坡度與繫泊需求：定量估算","titleEn":"Surface gradient and mooring demand: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「水面坡度與繫泊需求」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Surface gradient and mooring demand” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設排水質量10000000kg、長波近靜水坡度Δη/L=0.05/200，F≈mgΔη/L=24.525kN；不含拖曳與船體加速度。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume displaced mass10000000kg and long-wave quasi-hydrostatic slope0.05/200. F≈mgΔη/L=24.525kN, excluding drag and vessel acceleration. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：沿船首尾同步量水位並校正共同基準，確認可用小坡度近似，再與船體加速度及繫纜力比較相位。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Synchronize bow-and-stern levels on a common datum, check the small-gradient approximation and compare phases with acceleration and line force.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。假設排水質量10000000kg、長波近靜水坡度Δη/L=0.05/200，F≈mgΔη/L=24.525kN；不含拖曳與船體加速度。","textEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Assume displaced mass10000000kg and long-wave quasi-hydrostatic slope0.05/200. F≈mgΔη/L=24.525kN, excluding drag and vessel acceleration.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「水面坡度與繫泊需求」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Surface gradient and mooring demand\", which statement holds?","options":["平均水位上升率穩定就證明閘室所有位置都沒有水面振盪。","只要某一瞬間兩側水位相等就代表後續不會再有壓差。","教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。"],"optionsEn":["A steady mean rise proves that no surface oscillation exists anywhere in the chamber.","One instant of equal levels proves that no pressure difference can develop afterward.","Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"教學假設，非操作設定或設計允收值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching assumptions, not operating settings or design acceptance limits. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b292-v15-39","title":"水面坡度與繫泊需求：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Surface gradient and mooring demand: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「水面坡度與繫泊需求」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Surface gradient and mooring demand” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"沿船首尾同步量水位並校正共同基準，確認可用小坡度近似，再與船體加速度及繫纜力比較相位。分開射流、坡度和慣性來源，保留模型未解釋的反力而不靠調整質量湊合。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Synchronize bow-and-stern levels on a common datum, check the small-gradient approximation and compare phases with acceleration and line force. Separate jet, gradient and inertia contributions, retaining unexplained reaction rather than tuning vessel mass solely to make the calculation fit. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：沿船首尾同步量水位並校正共同基準，確認可用小坡度近似，再與船體加速度及繫纜力比較相位。分開射流、坡度和慣性來源，保留模型未解釋的反力而不靠調整質量湊合。","observationEn":"Site practice: Synchronize bow-and-stern levels on a common datum, check the small-gradient approximation and compare phases with acceleration and line force. Separate jet, gradient and inertia contributions, retaining unexplained reaction rather than tuning vessel mass solely to make the calculation fit.","failure":"注意干擾：水位儀基準相差幾公分便會製造假的縱坡，忽略船體慣性又可能把所有纜力都歸於水面差。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A small datum mismatch creates a false longitudinal slope, and omitted vessel inertia assigns too much line force to level difference. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"沿船首尾同步量水位並校正共同基準，確認可用小坡度近似，再與船體加速度及繫纜力比較相位。分開射流、坡度和慣性來源，保留模型未解釋的反力而不靠調整質量湊合。","textEn":"Synchronize bow-and-stern levels on a common datum, check the small-gradient approximation and compare phases with acceleration and line force. Separate jet, gradient and inertia contributions, retaining unexplained reaction rather than tuning vessel mass solely to make the calculation fit.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"沿船首尾同步量水位並校正共同基準，確認可用小坡度近似，再與船體加速度及繫纜力比較相位。分開射流、坡度和慣性來源，保留模型未解釋的反力而不靠調整質量湊合。","textEn":"Synchronize bow-and-stern levels on a common datum, check the small-gradient approximation and compare phases with acceleration and line force. Separate jet, gradient and inertia contributions, retaining unexplained reaction rather than tuning vessel mass solely to make the calculation fit.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「水面坡度與繫泊需求」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Surface gradient and mooring demand\"?","options":["沿船首尾同步量水位並校正共同基準，確認可用小坡度近似，再與船體加速度及繫纜力比較相位。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","灌水射流的全部動量反力都必定直接施加在閘內船舶上。"],"optionsEn":["Synchronize bow-and-stern levels on a common datum, check the small-gradient approximation and compare phases with acceleration and line force.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","The entire filling-jet momentum reaction necessarily acts directly on the vessel in the chamber."],"answer":0,"explanation":"沿船首尾同步量水位並校正共同基準，確認可用小坡度近似，再與船體加速度及繫纜力比較相位。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Synchronize bow-and-stern levels on a common datum, check the small-gradient approximation and compare phases with acceleration and line force. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b292-v15-40","title":"水面坡度與繫泊需求：失效診斷","titleEn":"Surface gradient and mooring demand: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"prerequisiteIds":["b292-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「水面坡度與繫泊需求」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Surface gradient and mooring demand” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"水位儀基準相差幾公分便會製造假的縱坡，忽略船體慣性又可能把所有纜力都歸於水面差。若用非同步峰值相減，甚至可能推得不存在的最大坡度。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A small datum mismatch creates a false longitudinal slope, and omitted vessel inertia assigns too much line force to level difference. Subtracting nonsynchronous peaks can even produce a maximum gradient that never existed in the chamber. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：假設排水質量10000000kg、長波近靜水坡度Δη/L=0.05/200，F≈mgΔη/L=24.525kN；不含拖曳與船體加速度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: F≈mgΔη/L=24.525kN, excluding drag and vessel acceleration.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「船舶所有繫纜力都可由兩端水位差單獨精確決定。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The complete vessel mooring force is exactly determined by end-to-end level difference alone.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b292-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"水位儀基準相差幾公分便會製造假的縱坡，忽略船體慣性又可能把所有纜力都歸於水面差。若用非同步峰值相減，甚至可能推得不存在的最大坡度。","textEn":"A small datum mismatch creates a false longitudinal slope, and omitted vessel inertia assigns too much line force to level difference. Subtracting nonsynchronous peaks can even produce a maximum gradient that never existed in the chamber.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]},{"id":"b292-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「水面坡度與繫泊需求」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Surface gradient and mooring demand\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","水位儀基準相差幾公分便會製造假的縱坡，忽略船體慣性又可能把所有纜力都歸於水面差。","閘室全部容積就是每次通航必須重新消耗的淡水量。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","A small datum mismatch creates a false longitudinal slope, and omitted vessel inertia assigns too much line force to level difference.","The entire chamber volume is fresh water that must be consumed anew on every transit."],"answer":1,"explanation":"水位儀基準相差幾公分便會製造假的縱坡，忽略船體慣性又可能把所有纜力都歸於水面差。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A small datum mismatch creates a false longitudinal slope, and omitted vessel inertia assigns too much line force to level difference. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v15s-lockhyd","v15s-panama-open","v15s-lockvalve","v15s-panama-trial","v15s-panama-location"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
